    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont want to dig it out. that sounds like so much more work i just dont have the strength for. it feels more like... if i let that version of me rest, i shouldn't have to keep up this charade of being a living person. it feels like the only way to actually be at peace is to just let the ghost take over completely. like, if there's nothing left of me, why should the body bother staying around?",
